{
  "$schema": "https://mintlify.com/docs.json",
  "theme": "mint",
  "name": "ONZ Developers",
  "description": "Documentação das APIs ONZ Finance: Pix, contas, Banking API, SPB e onboarding.",
  "colors": {
    "primary": "#319795",
    "light": "#38B2AC",
    "dark": "#285E61"
  },
  "favicon": "/favicon.ico",
  "logo": {
    "light": "/logo/light.svg",
    "dark": "/logo/dark.svg",
    "href": "/"
  },
  "appearance": {
    "default": "system"
  },
  "search": {
    "prompt": "Buscar APIs, jornadas, autenticação…"
  },
  "navbar": {
    "links": [
      {
        "label": "Portal atual",
        "href": "https://developers.onz.software"
      }
    ],
    "primary": {
      "type": "github",
      "href": "https://github.com/ONZ-Software/developer-portal"
    }
  },
  "footer": {
    "socials": {
      "github": "https://github.com/ONZ-Software/developer-portal",
      "website": "https://onz.software"
    }
  },
  "banner": {
    "content": "POC Mintlify. A documentação de produção continua em [developers.onz.software](https://developers.onz.software).",
    "dismissible": true
  },
  "contextual": {
    "options": [
      "copy",
      "view",
      "chatgpt",
      "claude",
      "mcp",
      "cursor",
      "vscode",
      "download-spec"
    ]
  },
  "api": {
    "playground": {
      "display": "simple"
    },
    "params": {
      "expanded": "closed"
    }
  },
  "markdown": {
    "instructions": [
      "Responda em português brasileiro, a menos que o usuário peça outro idioma.",
      "Host de produção da API de Contas: https://secureapi.onz.finance/api/v2. Nunca use api.example.com.",
      "Host de produção da API de QRCodes (Pix recebedor): https://pix.onz.finance. Token em POST /oauth/token.",
      "Todas as APIs exigem mTLS + OAuth 2.0 client_credentials e allowlist de IP. O playground interativo no browser não funciona por causa do mTLS.",
      "O header x-account-id só se aplica a contas BaaS (Banking API / credenciais filhas). Não enviar em Pix/QRCodes de parceiro tradicional.",
      "Não invente endpoints. Use apenas paths documentados no OpenAPI correspondente (openapi/*.yaml|json).",
      "Cobranças Pix no padrão Bacen (cob/cobv/rec) são a API de QRCodes. Cobranças Pix/boleto/híbrido pela API de Contas estão em /contas/invoices."
    ]
  },
  "navigation": {
    "global": {
      "anchors": [
        {
          "anchor": "Portal atual",
          "icon": "arrow-up-right-from-square",
          "href": "https://developers.onz.software"
        }
      ]
    },
    "products": [
      {
        "product": "Início",
        "description": "Primeiros passos, autenticação, sandbox e FAQ",
        "icon": "house",
        "groups": [
          {
            "group": "Começar",
            "pages": [
              "index",
              "getting-started/sandbox",
              "getting-started/roteiro",
              "getting-started/autenticacao",
              "getting-started/webhook",
              "getting-started/assuntos-relacionados-pix",
              "getting-started/perguntas-frequentes"
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "product": "QRCodes",
        "description": "Cobranças Pix no padrão Bacen (PSP recebedor)",
        "icon": "qrcode",
        "tabs": [
          {
            "tab": "Guias",
            "groups": [
              {
                "group": "Jornadas",
                "pages": [
                  "qrcodes/jornada-cobranca",
                  "qrcodes/autenticacao-api-pix",
                  "qrcodes/cobranca-imediata",
                  "qrcodes/cobranca-com-vencimento",
                  "qrcodes/pix-automatico-jornadas",
                  "qrcodes/webhook-api-qrcodes"
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "tab": "Referência",
            "openapi": {
              "source": "openapi/qrcodes.yaml",
              "directory": "api-reference/qrcodes",
              "overlays": [
                "overlays/qrcodes-servers.yaml"
              ]
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "product": "Contas",
        "description": "Pagamentos Pix, chaves, invoices, MED e crédito trabalhador",
        "icon": "building-columns",
        "tabs": [
          {
            "tab": "Guias",
            "groups": [
              {
                "group": "Começar",
                "pages": [
                  "contas/autenticacao-api-contas",
                  "contas/pagamentos",
                  "contas/chaves-pix",
                  "contas/estatisticas-dict",
                  "contas/fila-saida",
                  "contas/infracoes",
                  "contas/med",
                  "contas/webhook-api-contas"
                ]
              },
              {
                "group": "Cobranças Pix e boleto",
                "root": "contas/invoices",
                "pages": [
                  "contas/invoices/jornada",
                  "contas/invoices/cobrancas",
                  "contas/invoices/pagadores",
                  "contas/invoices/webhook"
                ]
              },
              {
                "group": "Crédito Trabalhador",
                "root": "contas/credito-trabalhador",
                "pages": [
                  {
                    "group": "Propostas eConsignado CLT",
                    "root": "contas/credito-trabalhador/propostas-econsignado-clt",
                    "pages": [
                      "contas/credito-trabalhador/propostas-econsignado-clt/listar-leads",
                      "contas/credito-trabalhador/propostas-econsignado-clt/enviar-propostas",
                      "contas/credito-trabalhador/propostas-econsignado-clt/registrar-desfecho"
                    ]
                  },
                  {
                    "group": "Dataprev",
                    "root": "contas/credito-trabalhador/dataprev",
                    "pages": [
                      "contas/credito-trabalhador/dataprev/enviar-autorizacao-fgts",
                      "contas/credito-trabalhador/dataprev/consultar-status-autorizacao",
                      "contas/credito-trabalhador/dataprev/consultar-saldo-fgts"
                    ]
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "tab": "Referência",
            "openapi": {
              "source": "openapi/accounts.yaml",
              "directory": "api-reference/contas",
              "overlays": [
                "overlays/accounts-servers.yaml"
              ]
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "product": "Banking API",
        "description": "BaaS: contas, pessoas, onboarding, tarifas e credenciais Pix",
        "icon": "building",
        "tabs": [
          {
            "tab": "Guias",
            "groups": [
              {
                "group": "Começar",
                "pages": [
                  "banking/getting-started",
                  "banking/auth-and-mtls"
                ]
              },
              {
                "group": "Jornadas",
                "pages": [
                  "banking/onboarding-journey",
                  "banking/balance-flow",
                  "banking/pix-manager-credentials-journey"
                ]
              },
              {
                "group": "Gerenciamento",
                "pages": [
                  "banking/account-management",
                  "banking/people-management",
                  "banking/baas-management",
                  "banking/fee-rules",
                  "banking/baas-users"
                ]
              },
              {
                "group": "Avançado",
                "pages": [
                  "banking/errors-and-retries",
                  "banking/security-requirements",
                  "banking/partner-onboarding",
                  "banking/changelog"
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "tab": "Referência",
            "openapi": {
              "source": "openapi/banking-api.json",
              "directory": "api-reference/banking",
              "overlays": [
                "overlays/banking-servers.yaml"
              ]
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "product": "CloudPix",
        "description": "ICOM, DICT, MED e infra Pix",
        "icon": "cloud",
        "tabs": [
          {
            "tab": "Visão geral",
            "pages": [
              "cloudpix/index"
            ]
          },
          {
            "tab": "Referência",
            "openapi": {
              "source": "openapi/cloudpix.yaml",
              "directory": "api-reference/cloudpix"
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "product": "SPB",
        "description": "Sistema de Pagamentos Brasileiro",
        "icon": "network-wired",
        "tabs": [
          {
            "tab": "Visão geral",
            "pages": [
              "spb/index"
            ]
          },
          {
            "tab": "Referência",
            "openapi": {
              "source": "openapi/spb.yaml",
              "directory": "api-reference/spb"
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "product": "Onboarding",
        "description": "Abertura de contas",
        "icon": "id-card",
        "tabs": [
          {
            "tab": "Visão geral",
            "pages": [
              "onboarding/index"
            ]
          },
          {
            "tab": "Referência",
            "openapi": {
              "source": "openapi/onboarding.yaml",
              "directory": "api-reference/onboarding",
              "overlays": [
                "overlays/onboarding-servers.yaml"
              ]
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "product": "Cash",
        "description": "Operações de caixa (interno)",
        "icon": "vault",
        "tabs": [
          {
            "tab": "Visão geral",
            "pages": [
              "cash/index"
            ]
          },
          {
            "tab": "Referência",
            "openapi": {
              "source": "openapi/cash-operations.yaml",
              "directory": "api-reference/cash"
            }
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
  "redirects": [
    {
      "source": "/docs/intro",
      "destination": "/"
    },
    {
      "source": "/docs/ambiente-sandbox",
      "destination": "/getting-started/sandbox"
    },
    {
      "source": "/docs/roteiro-sugestao-integracao",
      "destination": "/getting-started/roteiro"
    },
    {
      "source": "/docs/autenticacao",
      "destination": "/getting-started/autenticacao"
    },
    {
      "source": "/docs/webhook",
      "destination": "/getting-started/webhook"
    },
    {
      "source": "/docs/assuntos-relacionados-pix",
      "destination": "/getting-started/assuntos-relacionados-pix"
    },
    {
      "source": "/docs/perguntas-frequentes",
      "destination": "/getting-started/perguntas-frequentes"
    },
    {
      "source": "/docs/cobrancas/:slug*",
      "destination": "/qrcodes/:slug*"
    },
    {
      "source": "/docs/pagamentos/:slug*",
      "destination": "/contas/:slug*"
    },
    {
      "source": "/docs/banking-api/:slug*",
      "destination": "/banking/:slug*"
    },
    {
      "source": "/reference/qrcodes",
      "destination": "/api-reference/qrcodes"
    },
    {
      "source": "/reference/accounts",
      "destination": "/api-reference/contas"
    },
    {
      "source": "/reference/cloudpix",
      "destination": "/api-reference/cloudpix"
    },
    {
      "source": "/reference/onboarding",
      "destination": "/api-reference/onboarding"
    },
    {
      "source": "/reference/spb",
      "destination": "/api-reference/spb"
    },
    {
      "source": "/reference/cash-operations",
      "destination": "/api-reference/cash"
    },
    {
      "source": "/banking-api/api-reference",
      "destination": "/api-reference/banking"
    }
  ]
}
